# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Secrets and credentials (must never be committed per CLAUDE.md)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets.*
*credentials*
*token*
# Exception: this is a Deluge source function (Form_Token -> Referral_ID
# migration), not a credential file. Its name matches *token* above; keep it
# tracked. Any real token/credential file must still never be committed.
!functions/backfill_referral_id_from_token.dg

# Logs / temp
*.log
*.tmp

# Zoho app-definition exports (.ds) are the versioned source of truth for Deluge
# as of 2026-07-29. run_schema_monitor versions field tables only, not workflow or
# function bodies, so the .ds export is the only record of that code. Commit each
# dated export (SOS_Referrals_App_YYYY-MM-DD.ds) and keep SOS_Referrals_App.ds as a
# copy of the newest. Definition-only, no record data, no PHI. Do not ignore *.ds.
